{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10329","headline":"蓟门不遇王之[涣]郭密之因以留赠 · 高适","name":"蓟门不遇王之[涣]郭密之因以留赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"适远登蓟丘，兹晨独搔屑。\n贤交不可见，吾愿终难说。\n迢递千里游，羇离十年别。\n才华仰清兴，功业嗟芳节。\n旷荡阻云海，萧条带风雪。\n逢时事多谬，失路心弥折。\n行矣勿重陈，怀君但愁绝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10329.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10329","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}